      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "flight controller / firmware / integration / comms + telem\n    fcu firmware + pcb\nmotors + escs\n    pick motor\n    pick esc\n    design esc?\nsensors (imu, alt/height, possibly motor encoders)\n    sensor selection\n    sensor hardware, filtering, reading\nbattery + bms\n    battery selection\n    bms selection / board\n    charging system\n    power distribution\nvision\n    vision processor, board\nchassis\n    integration w/ rest of systems\n    custom chassis",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "flight controller / firmware / integration / comms + telem\n    fcu firmware + pcb\nmotors + escs\n    pick motor\n    pick esc\n    design esc?\nsensors (imu, alt/height, possibly motor encoders)\n    sensor selection\n    sensor hardware, filtering, reading\nbattery + bms\n    battery selection\n    bms selection / board\n    charging system\n    power distribution\nvision\n    vision processor, board\nchassis\n    integration w/ rest of systems\n    custom chassis",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
